WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.929
A preparer's portal hands you a pile of files.

00:00:05.929 --> 00:00:10.450
There's a passport in it, forms named whatever, and some of them twice.

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:13.505
Every number, traced to its page.

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:17.952
Open the Import tab and choose the files your preparer sent.

00:00:17.952 --> 00:00:21.917
They go to taxtrace on your own computer, and nowhere else.

00:00:21.917 --> 00:00:26.420
Nothing is filed yet: the page only reads what each file is called.

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:32.719
For each file, taxtrace shows its form, its tax year and its owner,

00:00:32.719 --> 00:00:34.135
and where it will go.

00:00:34.135 --> 00:00:36.631
A filed return goes to prior-returns.

00:00:36.631 --> 00:00:40.475
A passport is skipped, and so is a copy you already have.

00:00:42.880 --> 00:00:45.379
Press the button, and the rest are filed.

00:00:45.379 --> 00:00:48.670
Back on the Overview, they sit in their year's folder,

00:00:48.670 --> 00:00:53.180
each tagged with its form, and the older return is with the filed returns.
